QUERY PLAN:text
Nested Loop Left Join  (cost=0.00..0.08 rows=1 width=8)
  ->  Result  (cost=0.00..0.01 rows=1 width=0)
  ->  Function Scan on generate_series g  (cost=0.00..0.07 rows=1 width=4)
        Filter: (g = 3)
